      "relation": {
        "op": "eq",
        "left": "resourcesZ",
        "right": "resourcesZ"
      },
      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "REQ-resourcesZ-offset-must-not-be-neutered",
      "fine_trace_step": 3,
      "description": "Root cause. The dfont `resourcesZ` field uses the default null-safe `OffsetTo`, so sanitizer failure on the resource-record list is repaired by zeroing the offset instead of rejecting the malformed dfont. The fix changes this declaration to `OffsetTo<UnsizedArrayOf<ResourceRecord>, HBUINT16, false>` so zero is no longer treated as a repairable null."
    },
    {
